+### Heroic Icy Veins Difference
+
+- Icy Veins presents the fixed heroic order and mechanics broadly, but is less prescriptive about the exact 25H execution sequence.
+- The video-derived plan adds stricter handling: manipulate early bloods, deliberately feed scorpions with parasite sets, bait Korven amber onto Hisek, then Bloodlust Xaril and kill before a second `Catalyst`.
+- Practical call: use the video sequence as the raid plan; use Icy Veins to reinforce individual mechanic responsibilities like `Aim`, active mitigation, `Fiery Edge`, `Mesmerize`, and `Reave`.
+
